        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AF-B5, Paddle Lever with Ribbon and Reed Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simplicity of Fusion Hardware's Paddle Lever is so not to overwhelm the quiet beauty of the Ribbon and Reed Rose with which it is paired. A solid brass leverset, the ribbon and reed is a well-known design in French Colonial decor. This set is available in 3 finishes; and will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AF-B5 Paddle Lever and Ribbon and Reed Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Door Lever Fusion AF B5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Paddle Door Lever With Ribbon And Reed Rose, Fusion AF-B5",
                "description": "Paddle Lever With Ribbon and Reed Rose Fusion AF-B5 - The simplicity of Fusion Hardware's Paddle Lever is so not to overwhelm the quiet beauty of the Ribbon and Reed Rose with which it is paired. A solid brass leverset, the ribbon and reed is a well-known design in French Colonial decor. This set is available in 3 finishes; and will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
